ot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">*</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기한엄수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">*</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기한 내 우리대학 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">‘BISKIT’</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 입력 및 제출되어야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 33.6pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공인외국어시험 및 국제교류교육원에서 실시하는 모의토익</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모의토익스피킹 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모두 인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 33pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국제교류교육원에서 실시하는 모의토익</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모의토익스피킹 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">성적은 국제교류교육원에서 일괄 등록하므로 학생이 별도로 입력 및 제출하지 않아도 됨&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 33pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 하지만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">본인의 성적이 우리대학 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">‘BISKIT’</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 제대로 입력되어 있는지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">\"</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기한 내에</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">\" \"</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생본인이</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">\" “</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">반드시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">” </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">확인하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 33pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모의토익 성적이 제대로 반영되어 있지 않거나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모의토익 문의는 어학상담실 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">478-7959, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국제교류교육원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">478-7216</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">로 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 40pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교내 성적장학생은 외국어성적을 취득하여야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">외국어시험성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">토익기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">을 제출하지 않을 경우 성적장학생 선발에서 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 40pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 외국어시험성적은 장학선발의 기본자격이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자격충족자 중 우수자 선발</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 33.1pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.1pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">등록학기 기준으로 기준이 적용되오니 착오없으시기 바람</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 33.1pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.1pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">ex) 1-2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">학기 성적으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">2-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">학기 등록시 장학생으로 선정되기 위해서는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">학년 외국어성적기준을 충족해야함</span></b></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 33.1pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.1pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(현재 1학년은 2학년에 장학금수혜를 받을려면 2학년 외국어성적기준을 충족해야함)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">승인완료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">2027. 1. 8.(</font><font face=\"함초롬바탕\">금</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기한 내 우리대학 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">‘BISKIT’</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 승인완료 되어야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">미승인시 성적장학대상에서 제외 됨</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">▷ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제출 방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">붙임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">외국어성적 입력 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">’ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">참고 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공인외국어시험점수환산표수정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">붙임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1. 2027-1&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교내 성적장학생 선발관련 외국어성적표 제출 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">외국어성적입력방법</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공인외국어시험 점수 환산표&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
